# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
#
# Every file keeps its name across deploys except the bundler's output in /pkg/assets/, whose names carry a hash of
# their content. A file that keeps its name must be asked for again on every load (a cheap 304 when unchanged), or a
# browser runs yesterday's pixfx-canvas2d.js against today's pages and a new effect is "No such effect".
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# A hashed file never changes under its name: keep it for a year.
/pkg/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
